  "content": "<p>这是更新版本。原版内容请见<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fboat-cars\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</p><h2><strong>所需组件</strong></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a>。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2><strong>所有车辆</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/840/obrazek_2025-10-15_074953390-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></p><hr><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>马自达 MX-5</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/834/2025-05-13_10-30-16-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></p><hr><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>三菱 Eclipse</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/835/2025-05-13_10-33-05-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></p><hr><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>日产 Skyline R34 和本田 Prelude</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/836/2025-05-13_10-38-23-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></p><hr><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>马自达 RX-7</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/837/2025-05-13_10-41-51-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></p><hr><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>丰田 AE86</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/838/2025-05-13_10-44-28-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></p><hr><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>车聚</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/839/2025-05-13_10-48-47-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></p><hr><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>所有车辆</strong></h2><ul>\n<li>橡木船 =&nbsp;<strong>日产 Skyline R34</strong></li>\n<li>带箱子的橡木船 =&nbsp;<strong>日产 240SX</strong></li>\n<li>白桦木船 =&nbsp;<strong>斯巴鲁 Impreza</strong></li>\n<li>带箱子的白桦木船 =&nbsp;<strong>日产 Silvia S13</strong></li>\n<li>云杉木船 =&nbsp;<strong>三菱 Lancer Evo 9</strong></li>\n<li>带箱子的云杉木船 =&nbsp;<strong>马自达 RX-7 FD</strong></li>\n<li>丛林木船 =&nbsp;<strong>本田 Integra</strong></li>\n<li>带箱子的丛林木船 =&nbsp;<strong>本田 Prelude</strong></li>\n<li>金合欢木船 =&nbsp;<strong>三菱 Eclipse</strong></li>\n<li>带箱子的金合欢木船 =&nbsp;<strong>马自达 MX-5</strong></li>\n<li>深色橡木船 =&nbsp;<strong>福特 Shelby</strong></li>\n<li>带箱子的深色橡木船 =&nbsp;<strong>丰田 MR2</strong></li>\n<li>红树木船 =&nbsp;<strong>雪佛兰 Camaro</strong></li>\n<li>带箱子的红树木船 =&nbsp;<strong>马自达 RX-7 FC</strong></li>\n<li>樱花木船 =&nbsp;<strong>斯巴鲁 BRZ</strong></li>\n<li>带箱子的樱花木船 =&nbsp;<strong>丰田 AE86</strong></li>\n<li>带箱子的竹筏 =&nbsp;<strong>本田 Civic 6G</strong></li>\n</ul>",
